<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00218/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一个回形针，任何夹在里面的纸最终都会显现出0.3厘米的厚度，该项目理论上可以夹带无数张纸。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Dr.阙的办公桌上。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>收容于Dr.李的办公桌上。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>Dr.李跟我说这是个Keter级的收容物，而且我当时居然还信了！——Dr.阙</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00218" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00218" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00218-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jdque" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6406351); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6406351&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607828573" alt="jdque" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6406351)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jdque" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6406351); return false;">jdque</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1590409653 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">25 May 2020 12:27</span></p>
